  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tukamulane Soy Production Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Soy beans.Beneficiaries: 310 smallholder farmers.Location: Namwera, Malawi.Description: The grant will enable Tukamulane Farmers Association to sustain growth by funding improved seeds and other agricultural inputs, a crop purchase fund to enable Tukamulane to buy more soy beans from farmers, farming equipment, as well as production and management training to strengthen the cooperative and its members.</narrative>
  </description>
